    * Choosing the right Scalapack and MPI Libraries for your
       architecture is essential. If in doubt, refer to the
       documentation or the sysadmin of your supercomputer.
    * Please review our documentation of Makefile choices, particularly
       for ELPA, in the manual, and on our online tutorial.
       https://fhi-aims-club.gitlab.io/tutorials/cmake-tutorial/
   Advice and information on large scale calculations can be found in the manual,
 and at: https://fhi-aims-club.gitlab.io/tutorials/scaling-in-fhi-aims/
